<title>THAILAND: Siam Steel secures foreign loans.</title>
<headline>Siam Steel secures foreign loans.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Siam Steel International Plc said on Tuesday the company had secured a syndicated loans facility worth $30 million to refinance its existing loans.</p>
<p>The loan, which was arranged by HSBC Investment Asia Ltd, will carry an interest rate of SIBOR plus 1.00 percent with a three-year repayment period, Siam Steel said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
